    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00332",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "也许她正在咀嚼“斑蝥”这个从来没听见过的名称吧。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Perhaps she was turning over the unfamiliar name \"blister beetle\" in her mouth.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
