    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00332",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "然而，男人知道得一清二楚：那女人的心扉，又重新被关闭了。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Yet the man knew perfectly well that the woman's heart had closed itself off again.",
          "g": "predicate"
